[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>1. Act on the spring (1a) and release the reflector (1b) from the housing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/1225.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the reflector in the housing until the click of the spring is heard.</p><p>- Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]